   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Procurement of goods/equipment for Tackling Visceral Leismaniasis in South Asia and East Africa Lot 1 and Lot 2  is a component of Tackling Visceral Leishmaniasis (VL) in Asia &amp; Africa Lot 1 and Lot 2 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 103 - Procurement of goods and a budget of &#xA3;1,525,639. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control, Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
